Package: chattrBackground
Type: Package
Title: SARA - AI Coding Assistant with Tool Calling
Version: 2.0.0
Author: Michael Radhuber
Maintainer: Michael Radhuber <michael.radhuber@jku.at>
Description: SARA is an AI coding assistant with direct Ollama integration and tool calling support.
    SARA can automatically search R documentation, retrieve dataframes, access scripts, 
    and perform semantic text analysis on data. No background processes needed - runs directly 
    in Shiny with proper tool execution loop.
